Skip FreeFEM tests that fail or crash with the current dependency stack.

Several 3D tests fail non-deterministically or are terminated during the
test suite. The 3dSurf testvtk.edp test consistently crashes with a
segmentation fault.

Keep working tests such as tetgencube.edp, NSNewton.edp, and
optimcontrol.edp enabled.

